# text = It is quite a different sort of thing , my dear madam I am quite aware of that And I make allowances , Captain Brown Just allow me to read you a scene out of this month's number I had it only this morning , and I don't think the company can have read it yet As you please Fetch me ' Rasselas ,' my dear , out of the book-room Now allow me to read you a scene , and then the present company can judge between your favourite , Mr Boz , and Dr Johnson I imagine I am now justified in my preference of Dr Johnson as a writer of fiction I consider it vulgar , and below the dignity of literature , to publish in numbers How was the Rambler published , ma'am Dr Johnson's style is a model for young beginners .
