# text = My father recommended it to me when I began to write letters -- I have formed my own style upon it ; I recommended it to your favourite I should be very sorry for him to exchange his style for any such pompous writing I prefer Dr Johnson to Mr Boz D-n Dr Johnson After all , the Sunday morning's occurrence showed great goodness of heart The Honourable Mrs Jamieson has only just quitted me ; and , in the course of conversation , she communicated to me the intelligence that she had yesterday received a call from her revered husband's quondam friend , Lord Mauleverer .
