# text = My father was amongst them , meaning , he said , to ask them to walk into the garden with him , and admire the beautiful vegetable production , when -- oh , my dear , I tremble to think of it -- he looked through the rails himself , and saw -- I don't know what he thought he saw , but old Clare told me his face went quite grey - white with anger , and his eyes blazed out under his frowning black brows ; and he spoke out -- oh , so terribly !-- and bade them all stop where they were -- not one of them to go , not one of them to stir a step ; and , swift as light , he was in at the garden door , and down the Filbert walk , and seized hold of poor Peter , and tore his clothes off his back -- bonnet , shawl , gown , and all -- and threw the pillow among the people over the railings : and then he was very , very angry indeed , and before all the people he lifted up his cane and flogged Peter !
