# text = And when Phoebe was coming , I said to my husband , ' Sam , when the child is born , and I am strong , I shall leave you ; it will cut my heart cruel ; but if this baby dies too , I shall go mad ; the madness is in me now ; but if you let me go down to Calcutta , carrying my baby step by step , it will , maybe , work itself off ; and I will save , and I will hoard , and I will beg -- and I will die , to get a passage home to England , where our baby may live ?'
