# text = And Mr Hoggins is really a very personable man ; and as for his manners , why , if they are not very polished , I have known people with very good hearts and very clever minds too , who were not what some people reckoned refined , but who were both true and tender I am not crying for myself , dear I believe I am crying for the very silly thought of how my mother would grieve if she could know ; she always cared for us so much more than for herself .
