# text = And one day , I remember , I met Miss Matty in the lane that leads to Combehurst ; she was walking on the footpath , which , you know , is raised a good way above the road , and a gentleman rode beside her , and was talking to her , and she was looking down at some primroses she had gathered , and pulling them all to pieces , and I do believe she was crying .
