# text = But after she had passed , she turned round and ran after me to ask -- oh , so kindly -- about my poor mother , who lay on her death-bed ; and when I cried she took hold of my hand to comfort me -- and the gentleman waiting for her all the time -- and her poor heart very full of something , I am sure ; and I thought it such an honour to be spoken to in that pretty way by the rector's daughter , who visited at Arley Hall .
